#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "You do not have permission for the device of that cluster."
msgstr "Awunayo imvume yesixhobo saloo klasta."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Name: another cluster already uses this name."
msgstr "Igama: enye iklasta sele isebenzisa eli gama."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not saved: it was changed by someone else since the form was opened, or the write failed. Open it again and repeat the change."
msgstr "Iklasta ayigcinwanga: itshintshwe ngomnye umntu ukususela ekuvulweni kwefomu, okanye ukubhala akuphumelelanga. Yivule kwakhona uze uphinde utshintsho."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was saved."
msgstr "Iklasta igciniwe."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster state was not changed: the write failed. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Imeko yeklasta ayitshintshwanga: ukubhala akuphumelelanga. Jonga ilogi ye-Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster and its cached snapshot were deleted. Its device and graphs were kept. The scheduler was not contacted."
msgstr "Iklasta kunye ne-snapshot yayo egciniweyo kwi-cache zicinyiwe. Isixhobo sayo kunye neegrafu zayo zigciniwe. Umcwangcisi akazange aqhagamshelwe."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device and its graphs were created."
msgstr "Isixhobo kunye neegrafu zaso zenziwe."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device was not created: the cluster already has a device, it was changed by someone else since the page was opened, or Cacti refused it. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Isixhobo asenziwanga: iklasta sele inesixhobo, itshintshwe ngomnye umntu ukususela ekuvulweni kwephepha, okanye i-Cacti isalile. Jonga ilogi ye-Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was mapped to the device."
msgstr "Iklasta inxulunyaniswe nesixhobo."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not mapped: the device does not exist, is not allowed to you, already carries another cluster, or the cluster was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Iklasta ayinxulunyaniswanga: isixhobo asikho, awuvumelekanga kuso, sele sinenye iklasta, okanye iklasta itshintshwe ngomnye umntu ukususela ekuvulweni kwephepha."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Missing graphs were added."
msgstr "Iigrafu ezingekhoyo zongeziwe."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "No graphs were added: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Akukho zigrafu zongeziweyo: iklasta ayinasixhobo, okanye isixhobo sayo asisekho."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not unmapped: it was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Iklasta ayisuswanga kunxulumano: itshintshwe ngomnye umntu ukususela ekuvulweni kwephepha."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was unmapped. The device and its graphs were kept."
msgstr "Iklasta isusiwe kunxulumano. Isixhobo kunye neegrafu zaso zigciniwe."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were reindexed from the snapshot."
msgstr "Izahlulelo ziphinde zafakwa kwisalathisi ukusuka kwi-snapshot."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the device is disabled or down, so Cacti skipped its data query."
msgstr "Izahlulelo aziphindanga zafakwa kwisalathisi: isixhobo sikhubaziwe okanye asifikeleleki, ngoko i-Cacti iwutsibile umbuzo waso wedatha."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: Cacti could not run the data query. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Izahlulelo aziphindanga zafakwa kwisalathisi: i-Cacti ayikwazanga ukuqhuba umbuzo wedatha. Jonga ilogi ye-Cacti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the HPC Scheduler data query is not installed. Install the templates from the health page."
msgstr "Izahlulelo aziphindanga zafakwa kwisalathisi: umbuzo wedatha we-HPC Scheduler awufakwanga. Faka iitempleyithi ukusuka kwiphepha lempilo."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Izahlulelo aziphindanga zafakwa kwisalathisi: iklasta ayinasixhobo, okanye isixhobo sayo asisekho."

#: hpcsched_health.php
msgid "The HPC Scheduler templates are installed."
msgstr "Iitempleyithi ze-HPC Scheduler zifakiwe."

#: hpcsched_health.php
#, php-format
msgid "The templates were not installed: %s"
msgstr "Iitempleyithi azifakwanga: %s"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Monitoring view"
msgstr "Imboniselo yokubeka iliso"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Observations could not be read. Ask an administrator to check the plugin log."
msgstr "Iingqwalaselo azikwazanga ukufundwa. Cela umlawuli ajonge ilogi ye-plugin."

#: include/operator.php
msgid "Inspect pending reason families and snapshot freshness on the overview. Escalate credentials, cluster mappings and maintenance policy to an administrator."
msgstr "Hlola iintsapho zezizathu zokulinda kunye nobutsha be-snapshot kwisishwankathelo. Dlulisela iingqinisekiso, unxulumaniso lweklasta kunye nomgaqo-nkqubo wolondolozo kumlawuli."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Name: use 1 to 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, starting with a letter or digit."
msgstr "Igama: sebenzisa oonobumba abayi-1 ukuya ku-64, amanani, amachaphaza, oonotsheke, okanye i-underscore, uqale ngonobumba okanye ngenani."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Poller: choose one of the listed pollers."
msgstr "Ipoller: khetha enye yeepoller ezidwelisiweyo."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Collection Interval: enter whole seconds from %d to %d."
msgstr "Ixesha loQokelelo: faka imizuzwana epheleleyo ukusuka ku-%d ukuya ku-%d."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Transport: choose one of the listed transports."
msgstr "Uthutho: khetha olunye lwezothutho ezidwelisiweyo."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurm.conf: enter an absolute path, or leave it empty to use the poller default."
msgstr "slurm.conf: faka umendo opheleleyo, okanye uyishiye ingenanto ukuze usebenzise okusisiseko kwe-poller."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: this host and port are not on the slurmrestd host list in Settings."
msgstr "slurmrestd URL: lo mamkeli kunye ne-port azikho kuluhlu lwabamamkeli be-slurmrestd kwiisetingi."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: enter an https:// URL without user name, query, or fragment; plain http:// is accepted only for a loopback address."
msgstr "slurmrestd URL: faka i-URL ye-https:// engenagama lomsebenzisi, umbuzo, okanye iqhekeza; i-http:// eqhelekileyo yamkelwa kuphela kwidilesi ye-loopback."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd User: use at most 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, or leave it empty for a user token."
msgstr "Umsebenzisi we-slurmrestd: sebenzisa ubuninzi boonobumba abangama-64, amanani, amachaphaza, oonotsheke, okanye i-underscore, okanye uyishiye ingenanto kwi-token yomsebenzisi."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: enter the absolute path of the token file on the poller. The token itself is never entered here."
msgstr "Ifayile ye-Token: faka umendo opheleleyo wefayile ye-token kwi-poller. I-token ngokwayo ayifakwa apha nakanye."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: no token file directories are set yet. Ask a Cacti administrator to set them under Settings, HPC Scheduler."
msgstr "Ifayile ye-Token: akukho zikhombisi zefayile ye-token zimiselweyo okwangoku. Cela umlawuli we-Cacti azimisele phantsi kwe-Settings, HPC Scheduler."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Token File: the file must be inside one of the token file directories set in Settings (%s)."
msgstr "Ifayile ye-Token: ifayile kufuneka ibe ngaphakathi kwesinye sezikhombisi zefayile ye-token ezimiselwe kwiisetingi (%s)."

