#: lib/ClustersPage.php
msgid "Client commands use the binaries set under Settings > HPC Scheduler and the poller user's own Slurm authentication; the optional slurm.conf path selects a cluster. slurmrestd fields are used only with that transport. The token file must be readable by the poller user only; the plugin reads it at each run and never stores the token."
msgstr "Imiyalelo yomxhasi isebenzisa ii-binary ezimiselwe phantsi kwe-Settings > HPC Scheduler kunye nokuqinisekiswa kwe-Slurm komsebenzisi we-poller; umendo we-slurm.conf ongumkhetho ukhetha iklasta. Iinkalo ze-slurmrestd zisetyenziswa kuphela naloo thutho. Ifayile ye-token kufuneka ifundeke ngumsebenzisi we-poller kuphela; i-plugin iyifunda ekuqhubeni ngakunye kwaye ayisoze iyigcine i-token."

