#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Maximum Answer Size is %d MiB, but a decoded answer of that size does not fit in the Collection Memory of %d MiB; the reader allows %d MiB. Raise Collection Memory or lower Maximum Answer Size in Settings."
msgstr "I-Maximum Answer Size yi-%d MiB, kodwa impendulo ehlaziyiweyo yaloo sayizi ayingeni kwi-Collection Memory eyi-%d MiB; umfundi uvumela i-%d MiB. Phakamisa i-Collection Memory okanye uthobe i-Maximum Answer Size kwiisetingi."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Assigned to poller %d, a remote data collector. This release collects only on the main poller, so the cluster is not collected; remote collection is planned for phase 3. Assign it to the main poller."
msgstr "Inikezelwe kwi-poller %d, umqokeleli wedatha okude. Olu khupho luqokelela kuphela kwi-poller engundoqo, ngoko iklasta ayiqokelelwa; uqokelelo olukude lucwangciselwe isigaba sesi-3. Yinikezele kwi-poller engundoqo."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The collection interval is below the %d second floor."
msgstr "Isithuba soqokelelo singaphantsi komgangatho ophantsi wemizuzwana eyi-%d."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The collection interval of %d seconds is shorter than the poller interval of %d seconds; data is collected every %d seconds."
msgstr "Isithuba soqokelelo semizuzwana eyi-%d sifutshane kunesithuba se-poller semizuzwana eyi-%d; idatha iqokelelwa rhoqo emva kwemizuzwana eyi-%d."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
msgid "slurmrestd is reached over plain HTTP on the loopback address; the token crosses the local network stack unencrypted."
msgstr "I-slurmrestd ifikelelwa nge-HTTP eqhelekileyo kwidilesi ye-loopback; i-token iwela uthungelwano lwendawo ingafihlwanga."

#: lib/HealthWarnings.php
