#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Data Parser"
msgstr "Umhlalutyi weDatha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Slurm data parser for the client commands. Choose one that the release of every cluster read through client commands ships: v0.0.43 is in 25.05, 25.11, and 26.05 and is removed in 27.05; v0.0.44 needs 25.11 or later; v0.0.45 needs 26.05 or later. The health page warns when a cluster reports a release without it. Clusters read through slurmrestd ignore this setting: they use the newest of these the daemon serves, and the health page shows which."
msgstr "Umhlalutyi wedatha we-Slurm wemiyalelo yomxhasi. Khetha omnye oza nogqithiselo lweklasta nganye efundwa ngemiyalelo yomxhasi: i-v0.0.43 ikwi-25.05, 25.11, kunye ne-26.05 kwaye isusiwe kwi-27.05; i-v0.0.44 ifuna i-25.11 okanye emva koko; i-v0.0.45 ifuna i-26.05 okanye emva koko. Iphepha lempilo liyalumkisa xa iklasta ibika ugqithiselo olungenayo. Iiklasta ezifundwa nge-slurmrestd ziyayihoya le setingi: zisebenzisa eyona intsha kwezi ebonelelwa yi-daemon, kwaye iphepha lempilo libonisa ukuba yeyiphi."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to squeue on each poller that reads a cluster through client commands. The plugin runs it only as squeue --all --json with the data parser above."
msgstr "Indlela epheleleyo eya ku-squeue kwi-poller nganye efunda iklasta ngemiyalelo yomxhasi. I-plugin iyisebenzisa kuphela njengo squeue --all --json kunye nomhlalutyi wedatha ongasentla."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "squeue"
msgstr "squeue"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to scontrol. The plugin runs only scontrol --json show node, show partition, and show reservation; never update, reconfigure, or token."
msgstr "Indlela epheleleyo eya ku scontrol. I-plugin isebenzisa kuphela scontrol --json show node, show partition, kunye ne show reservation; ayisoze isebenzise update, reconfigure, okanye token."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "scontrol"
msgstr "scontrol"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to sshare, used only for clusters that collect fair-share."
msgstr "Indlela epheleleyo eya ku sshare, isetyenziselwa kuphela iiklasta eziqokelela isabelo esifanelekileyo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "sshare"
msgstr "sshare"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "Imida"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Call Timeout"
msgstr "Ixesha lokuPhelelwa koBizo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one scheduler call may take before it is stopped and its section recorded as failed. A call never runs past the reader time budget either."
msgstr "Imizuzwana enokuthathwa lubizo olunye lomcwangcisi phambi kokuba lumiswe kwaye icandelo lalo libhalwe njengelingaphumelelanga. Ubizo aluze ludlule nakwixesha elibekelwe umfundi."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Answer Size"
msgstr "Ubungakanani boPhendulo obona buKhulu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB one scheduler call may return. A larger answer is discarded and its section recorded as failed. Decoding needs about 12 times the answer size, so the reader uses at most (Collection Memory - 64) / 12 MiB and the health page warns when this value is larger."
msgstr "Ii-MiB ezinokubuyiswa lubizo olunye lomcwangcisi. Impendulo enkulu kunoko iyalahlwa kwaye icandelo layo libhalwe njengelingaphumelelanga. Ukuchaza ikhowudi kufuna malunga namaxesha ali-12 obungakanani bempendulo, ngoko ke umfundi usebenzisa ubuninzi obungu (IMemori yoQokelelo - 64) / 12 MiB kwaye iphepha lempilo liyalumkisa xa eli xabiso likhulu."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection Memory"
msgstr "IMemori yoQokelelo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB of PHP memory each collection run raises its limit to (it never lowers one). The default of 1024 fits answers up to 80 MiB."
msgstr "Ii-MiB zememori ye-PHP apho ugqithiso ngalunye loqokelelo luyinyusa khona imida yalo (aluyithobi nanini na). Useto oluhlala lukhona lwe-1024 lulingana neempendulo eziya kuma kwi-80 MiB."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to prlimit (util-linux), used to cap the address space of each client command. Leave empty to run commands without a memory limit; the health page then warns."
msgstr "Indlela epheleleyo eya ku prlimit (util-linux), esetyenziselwa ukumisela indawo yedilesi yomyalelo ngamnye womxhasi. Shiya kungenanto ukuze uqhube imiyalelo ngaphandle komda wememori; iphepha lempilo liza kulumkisa ke ngoko."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "prlimit"
msgstr "prlimit"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Command Memory Limit"
msgstr "Umda weMemori yoMyalelo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB of address space each client command may use, through prlimit."
msgstr "Ii-MiB zendawo yedilesi ezinokusetyenziswa ngumyalelo ngamnye womxhasi, ngo prlimit."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "slurmrestd Credentials"
msgstr "Iziqinisekiso ze-slurmrestd"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Token File Directories"
msgstr "Izikhombisi zeeFayile zeThokheni"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute directories on the pollers that may hold slurmrestd token files, separated by commas or spaces. A cluster can name only a token file inside one of them, owned by the poller user and reached without a symbolic link. Keep each directory writable only by root and the poller user. Empty means no cluster can use slurmrestd."
msgstr "Izikhombisi ezipheleleyo kwi-pollers ezinokubamba iifayile zethokheni ye-slurmrestd, ezahlulwe ngeekoma okanye izikhewu. Iklasta ingathiya kuphela ifayile yethokheni ngaphakathi kwesinye sazo, ekhokelwa ngumsebenzisi we-poller kwaye ifikelelwe ngaphandle kwesikhonkwane esifanekiselayo. Gcina isikhombisi ngasinye sibhaleka kuphela ngu-root kunye nomsebenzisi we-poller. Ukungabikho kwento kuthetha ukuba akukho klasta inokusebenzisa i-slurmrestd."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "slurmrestd Hosts"
msgstr "IiHost ze-slurmrestd"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Optional. The slurmrestd hosts a cluster may name, as host or host:port, separated by commas or spaces. An entry without a port allows any port on that host. Empty allows any host."
msgstr "Uyazikhethela. Iihost ze-slurmrestd ezinokubizwa yiklasta, njenge host okanye host:port, ezahlulwe ngeekoma okanye izikhewu. Ungeno olungenayo i-port luvumela nayiphi na i-port kuloo host. Ukuba akukho nto kuvumela nayiphi na i-host."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds before a token expires when the health page starts to warn, if the token carries an expiry time."
msgstr "Imizuzwana phambi kokuba ithokheni iphelelwe lixesha xa iphepha lempilo liqala ukulumkisa, ukuba ithokheni inalo ixesha lokuphelelwa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Token Expiry Warning"
msgstr "Isilumkiso sokuPhelelwa kweThokheni"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Khupha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Gcina iiTheyibhile ze-Plugin xa uKhupha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its clusters and snapshots. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the clusters first from HPC Clusters. The plugin creates no Cacti devices or Maint schedules in this release, and the scheduler is never contacted either way."
msgstr "Xa kukhangelwe, ukukhupha i-plugin kugcina iiklasta zayo kunye nemifanekiso yomzuzwana. Yisuse ukuze ukukhupha kuzilahle; thumela ngaphandle iiklasta kuqala kwi-HPC Clusters. I-plugin ayenzi zixhobo ze-Cacti okanye iishedyuli ze-Maint kolu gqithiselo, kwaye umcwangcisi akasoze athintwe nakweyiphi na indlela."

